summary.label:
This app helps parents book and manage VIPKid English classes for their child.

Main functions:
This app can be used to book or cancel VIPKid trial and regular classes.
VIPKid curriculum helps students:
establish a solid foundation for future English study;
speak English with fluency;
meet challenges at school with full confidence.
VIPKid curriculum advantages:
Taught 100% by North American teachers who are certified;
Delievered in one-on-one format with all the attention devoted to your child;
Developed by teaching experts and tested by millions of students around the world.
